<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 31.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 31.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   98/100   100/102    UNQ    168/172</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	 103/105   105/107  178/180  183/185</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Crude gains and a firm fuel oil cargo market continued to support bunker levels on Thursday and traders expected the upward momentum to continue. Bunker 380-cst suppliers were quoted about $1-$2 per tonne higher than Wednesday's levels.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
